                    "doc": "The areas in which a country is divided. There are different meanings for region depending on the country: State, region, country, canton. For example region is used as: Australia - Province Brazil - State Canada - Province Germany - State Great Britain - County Italy - Province Japan - Prefecture Switzerland - Canton"
